Panoramic view of connector industry chain: widely used in downstream
China has become the world’s largest connector market
In 2019, the Chinese mainland connector market accounted for 31.4% of the world’s market share, making it the world’s largest connector sales market.
China’s connector manufacturing trade surplus expands year by year
Connector manufacturing industry from 2017 to 2020, China trade surplus continued to expand, mainly because of electronics manufacturing shift to China, domestic large connector production enterprise has introduced the advanced research and development, production equipment, has formed a high level of research and development team, narrowed the technology gap with international leading enterprises, the competition strength significantly strengthened.
Although China is the world’s largest connector market, but due to China’s connector industry started relatively late, the current production of connector is mainly low-end, high-end products market share is low. Domestic connector products lack independent research and development and related standards, high-end product manufacturers are few, the quality is general; In addition, most domestic manufacturers are small and lack cost advantages compared with overseas manufacturers.
