What are the daily maintenance items for automatic molding machines?
When the automatic molding machine arrives at the customer site, first confirm whether there is any damage to the appearance and whether the molding machine is damaged due to transportation or lifting;
Confirm that the base of the molding machine is in firm contact with the foundation, the equipment is leveled, and the base must not be suspended.
The walking frame of the middle box walks smoothly, without obvious shaking and interference. There is no gap in the box, no tilt, no tilt in demolding (four rollers are in contact with the guide rail at the same time and the template is level), and no interference (the edges of the four rollers are not in contact with the guide rail);
After all the individual actions of manual operation are normal, one-button box closing and one-button reset action can be carried out. All proximity switches and magnetic switches are positioned accurately without looseness.
After setting the lubrication pump, check whether it is working normally;
The heating setting of the upper box is completed to check whether it is working normally;
After the air conditioner is set, check whether it is working normally;
Modeling test to observe whether the sealing ring is sealed and whether the level gauge is accurate;
After the modeling test is completed, check whether all bolts and nuts are loose and tighten them. At the same time, check whether the line joints and pipelines are loose and tighten;
