The fourth debugging of surgical shadowless lamp - joint sensitivity: Because the viewpoint of shadowless lamp needs to be adjusted, the sensitivity of the joint is also very important, mainly adjusting the damping screw of the joint. The standard rule is that the tightness of the damping adjustment is the force of advancing or rotating the joint in any direction at 20N or 5Nm.
The sixth debugging of surgical shadowless lamp - illumination and color temperature inspection: This is the more important point of surgical shadowless lamp. Excellent illumination and color temperature help doctors to carefully observe the patient's trauma, distinguish organs, blood, etc., so it is close to the illumination of sunlight and 4400 -4600K color temperature is more suitable.
