At websetnet.net, the privacy of our visitors is of extreme importance to us. This privacy policy document outlines the types of personal information is received and collected by websetnet.net and how it is used.
Like many other Web sites, websetnet.net makes use of log files. The information inside the log files includes internet protocol ( IP ) addresses, type of browser, Internet Service Provider ( ISP ), date/time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks to analyze trends, administer the site, track user’s movement around the site, and gather demographic information.
Cookies and Web Beacons websetnet.net does use cookies to store information about visitors preferences, record user-specific information on which pages the user access or visit, customize Web page content based on visitors browser type or other information that the visitor sends via their browser.
You should consult the respective privacy policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information on their practices as well as for instructions about how to opt-out of certain practices. websetnet.net’s privacy policy does not apply to, and we cannot control the activities of, such other advertisers or web sites.
