With how popular Instagram has become since its launch in 2010, this app continues to innovate its platform. In this sense, we want to tell you about one of the updates that is a solution to some problems that you may have.
This archiving tool makes it possible to stop being visible any photo or video for other people, but that remains visible at all times for you. In the same way, it keeps the "likes", the comments and the description so that in case you change your mind you can restore the publication and it will be as before.
Then you already have this new option that will allow you to hide those photos and videos that give you a little shame that other people can see, but that has something you still like and that's why you don't want to delete it permanently. And the best thing is that the way to do it is very simple.
The first thing you should do is is enter your profile where your posts are located and choose the one you want to archive. Then, click on the options button in the upper right, which is indicated with three dots.
For many users this new function is very useful for those occasions in the It seems that some of your publications are no longer consistent with your style. Since there is no need for you to erase the photo or video, but you will only make it invisible to other people.
The main objective of this tool is that people can make unimportant publications, as is the case in the Instagram stories ephemeral Since counting on her they can hide from the sight of others those photos that they regret uploading.
Although it may seem that this tool has nothing wrong, the truth is that it does. Since the fact of being able to archive a publication also results in that does not receive more reactions from other users.
That's why Instagram decides to create a function so that people don't feel self-conscious about publishing any content, but have the confidence of being able to upload everything they want for hoping to hide it when they no longer want other people to see it. This new function is a tool that the user has to be able to upload the content that perhaps before did not dare to do so.
And in response to all this entanglement that caused to define whether to post some content because perhaps it did not represent all that image created within this application. Since it seeks to create the best perspective for each person, at least that's what many users worry about.
The decision is on the part of each person, depending on the need you have or how much you stop liking the publication that once uploaded to the social network. But without a doubt, the tool that allows you to archive the photos and videos was created in order to Do not have to delete any content permanently.
Therefore, it can be said that within the most recent updates, this is one of the ones that the public who uses Instagram has liked the most. Because it represents a halfway solution for posts you no longer want, and by "halfway" we mean that represents a midpoint between deleting and maintaining the photo or video.
