What do the suggestions mean?
However, from ads that reflect recently accessed sites to search suggestions that resemble accounts the user has visited for weeks, the way the app uses this data to deliver this personalized experience may be annoying to much. Either out of curiosity, privacy care or simply because you want to manage your account however you want.
The account suggestions in the search field are based on several criteria, the most important of which is your own search and interaction history. Unless your history has been recently cleared, the suggested accounts will generally be the ones you searched for, the ones you visit frequently, and the ones you interact with the most by message.
