The second type of ad are Facebook Marketing Partners, also called Facebook Partners; that they will be people of great trust (that is, us) and we will create all the necessary campaign. The third type are Insertion orders, also called PI; Mostly used by companies that are already large and heyday.
Throughout the article, we mentioned that the advertiser could give the budget that he wanted; however, we may recommend one, based on the other auction announcements; taking into account even more prices, quality, relevance, frequency, among other factors; as this will determine whether the advertising will be successful or not.
As sponsors, we must also take the best advertising offers and those that we can predict that will have better results and more chances of winning at the auction. It is highly recommended that you use this form of ad, since it is the one that is used the most and the one that presents the best results for our client.
The daily budget is the one that we have talked about throughout this article, based on the number of days, can you calculate?how much to charge for advertising on Facebook?
To give you an example, the advertiser is willing to budget USD3 per day, for 30 days; If we multiply this amount by the total number of days, it would give us USD 90, which is the total for the services, during that period of time.
El Budget per ad set, is another of the ways in which we can charge the advertiser; In this case, the client will give us the budget (as always) and we are the ones who will see if, depending on the number of days and the money allocated to each day, it is worth it or not, to invest that money.
