But the angelic face can also be used ironically, for actions or behaviors that are not very good.
Don't take me seriously!
Used when the person is happy that something unpleasant has ended. It can also mean that the person is relaxed, free from worry.
This happy face with heart-shaped eyes shows that the person is madly in love and can be for a person, place, or even an object. It is a good emoji to send to your crush.
This emoji shows an expressionless face with a neutral look. It means that the person is indifferent to the situation.
It is an expression of nervousness or embarrassment. It can also be used as a slightly guilty smile, of someone who has done something stupid and tries to resolve the tense situation by making faces.
This emoji is used to represent a feeling of disdain, contempt, or rancor towards someone or something that has been said previously. It can also be used to identify that a certain message was sarcastic.
This emoji means that the person was so upset with what was said that they could almost throw up. It is used as a form of disapproval of something.
This mischievous smile with little devil horns wants to show that the person wants to cause trouble. It can also be used maliciously or sexually.
This emoji shows two hands clapping and is mainly used to express consent and thanks. It can also be used sarcastically, if something really doesn't deserve any applause!
This fist is used to encourage someone or to say that you agree with someone who is on their side. On the other hand, it can also be interpreted as a coup threat.
I'm watching you!
It is used when you hear or see someone doing something stupid, but it can also be used if you feel "ashamed of others." Shrugging
This shrugging emoji shows ignorance, confusion, or a lack of interest in something. It comes from the emoticon ¯ \ _ (ツ) _ / ¯.
Peach emojis have been widely used to represent asses, due to the visual similarity perceived by many users. This led him to be known as a "butt emoticon."
The full moon is the original euphemism used for the butt. In fact, in the United States, the moon has been used to describe donkeys since 1743, long before the peach emoji was invented.
The black moon emoji is often used to underline the sexual meaning in a sentence. Flirting is often used or to make a sexual joke.
This smiling poop emoji is used in various contexts. A common use is to say that the content is bad, but it can also be used to express passive aggressiveness, thanks to the happy, smiling face of this pile of poop.
Many people think that this emoji represents someone who snorts in anger. But in reality, these white clouds that come out of the nose want to represent disdain, a sign of superiority.
