How do you know who has blocked you on Facebook?
This articleHow to know who has blocked you on Facebook?, It is important for many users of this social network, who for some reason have not realized that it has been blocked.
The Facebook tool does not offer its users any type of message when one user has proceeded to block another, so that you do not have to find out at the time it was done.
You must enter the Facebook website, look for the profile option, click on the name that appears at the top, in the area of the phone number, point out where the three small stripes appear horizontally that allows you to open the menu, click on the name of your user, and check the list of friends.
To be more sure you can create a post in "Tag person", place the name of the friend, and if it does not appear, the possibility that it has blocked is high.
The Facebook tool, at no time shows the user that he has been blocked by any of his contacts, however, it is something that can be discovered in a simple way.
Another way to know is to try to send him a message on Facebook Messenger, and if you can't get the message to be sent, showing an error means that the user is not available on your friends list.
Another easy way to find out if you have been blocked is through the "Search" option, doing the following steps:
A list of profiles and pages appears, the search must be filtered by clicking on the "People" option, if it has been blocked, the profile of the contact that blocked you does not appear in this filter.
